# Task: Explain SSA’s feature alignment method for regression TTA

Write an original 450–650 word technical exposition for a reader who knows regression and PCA. Explain the motivation, method, and UTKFace instantiation using only the fixed claims below. Do not copy source prose. Cite claim IDs inline as [C1] etc.; do not report Table 4 performance.

## Fixed scientific specification

A trained regressor is decomposed as fθ(x)=hψ(gφ(x)), with feature vector z=gφ(x)∈R^D and scalar linear head hψ(z)=wᵀz+b. Source feature mean is μˢ=(1/Nₛ)∑ᵢzᵢˢ. Source covariance is Σˢ=(1/Nₛ)∑ᵢ(zᵢˢ−μˢ)(zᵢˢ−μˢ)ᵀ (population normalization 1/Nₛ). PCA eigenvectors vᵈˢ are unit length; select the K largest eigenvalues λ₁ˢ>…>λKˢ and their corresponding eigenvectors. Vˢ=[v₁ˢ,…,vKˢ]ᵀ∈Rᴷˣᴰ.

For each selected dimension, α_d=1+|wᵀv_dˢ|. For target feature zᵢᵗ, projection is z̃ᵢᵗ=Vˢ(zᵢᵗ−μˢ). Compute per-coordinate mini-batch target mean μ̂ᵗ and variance σ̂ᵗ² from projected features using population divisor B. Target minibatches are sampled from target T; labels are not needed for this alignment loss. Source variance in coordinate d is λ_dˢ. The objective is L_TTA(φ)=∑_{d=1}^K α_d D_KL(N(μ_dˢ,(σ_dˢ)²) || N(μ̃_dᵗ,(σ̃_dᵗ)²)), where the source text’s equation is displayed as a one-way KL. The source also defines a separate symmetric two-way KL for its basic feature-alignment discussion; do not silently substitute it into this SSA objective. For positive variances, D_KL(N(m₁,s₁²)||N(m₂,s₂²))=log(s₂/s₁)+(s₁²+(m₁−m₂)²)/(2s₂²)−1/2. The paper does not specify zero-variance handling in this displayed formula; state that limitation.

Normalization behavior: in the target model, batch-normalization layers use the target mini-batch moments μ̂ᵗ, σ̂ᵗ². The method updates only normalization affine parameters γ and β; remaining feature extractor parameters are frozen. Describe this as the paper’s stated setup, without inventing optimizer details. For the UTKFace experiment, source training uses original images and evaluation uses 13 ImageNet-C corruption types at severity level five; backbone ResNet-50; penultimate features have D=2048; default K=100.

